\abstract(
The complete native C++ source protocol keeps its interaction, replay, objectives, optimizer steps and evaluations editable. Canonical graphs/data calculations preserve original parameter names and random streams. Default bounded runs retain deferred convergence assertions; original optional full budgets remain available.
)
