// Editable workflow support: rl/pg_common.hpp
// datamunge::nn port of tflow_examples src/common/rl/pg_common.h.
// Pieces shared by the policy-gradient and actor-critic examples: config,
// a softmax actor + value critic built from nn layers, action sampling,
// discounted returns and GAE on the host, and batched rollouts from a VecEnv.
// Monitor, Evaluate and Adam are reused from dqn_common.hpp.
//
// Changes from the TF version: BuildActorCritic runs the network on a
// tensor (eager) instead of adding graph nodes, ObsMatrix/IntVector return
// nn::Tensor (actions as int64), and TF hardware options are ignored.


// Editable workflow support: rl/dqn_common.hpp
// datamunge::nn port of tflow_examples src/common/rl/dqn_common.h.
// Pieces shared by the DQN-family examples: hyper-parameters, the epsilon
// schedule, a training monitor, Q-value heads (plain / dueling), greedy
// evaluation, the C51 distribution projection, and Adam with global-norm
// clipping (tflow's nn::Adam).
//
// Changes from the TF version: the TF hardware options (device=, threads=,
// xla=) are accepted and ignored, since nn runs eagerly on the CPU; QHead
// builds on a ParameterStore and returns a tensor instead of adding graph
// nodes; the noisy-network head (nn::NoisyDense) is not included, because
// datamunge::nn has no noisy layer yet.


